**/.git
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/.claude
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/*.user

# Local-only files: secrets and log output must never be baked into an image
**/.env
**/*.env
**/logs

# Environment-specific settings are local-only; images get the committed appsettings.json
# and are configured through environment variables.
**/appsettings.*.json
